Umbrella CloudBSD metaport for GPU DRM kernel modules.

Installs the full multi-vendor CloudBSD DRM stack appropriate for the
running FreeBSD version (currently the 6.6 split line on FreeBSD 15+
amd64): core modules plus AMD, Intel, Radeon, and NVIDIA DRM drivers,
firmware, and the cloudbsd-gpu-detect helper.

This is the "install them all" package. Individual vendors can also be
installed via cloudbsd-drm-66-*-kmod ports without this meta.
